{"4452790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smiglee's Statues: The Cursed Curation", "steam_appid": 4452790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 30 minute narrative puzzle horror experience, you finish the last tasks of the day inside a crudely beautiful, retro-inspired museum restoration shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of years of history surround you — documented, tagged, and ready for return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for one statue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...When the other workers stood near it, they felt cold. Uneasy. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He had to admit, he didn’t remember seeing it before. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>I guess it’s up to me to clean and catalog this statue tonight,</i> thought Mr. Smiglee.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/9b3b4c58f40e52659ac320bf0a7e3d7b.poster.avif?t=1786110752\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/9b3b4c58f40e52659ac320bf0a7e3d7b.webm?t=1786110752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/9b3b4c58f40e52659ac320bf0a7e3d7b.mp4?t=1786110752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine and catalog artifacts:</strong> Physically interact with objects throughout the shop, review documentation, and update records as inconsistencies begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore damaged pieces:</strong> Clean, repair, and prepare statues for shipment using hands-on interactions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photograph your work:</strong> Capture archival images and inspect them closely — <i>some details are easier to notice in a photograph than in person.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/8dcf89c2b742837c3a55ad45fcab3d5d.poster.avif?t=1786110752\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/8dcf89c2b742837c3a55ad45fcab3d5d.webm?t=1786110752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452790/extras/8dcf89c2b742837c3a55ad45fcab3d5d.mp4?t=1786110752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's just hope that finicky circuit breaker doesn't give out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 30 minute narrative puzzle horror experience, you finish the last tasks of the day inside a crudely beautiful, retro-inspired museum restoration shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of years of history surround you — documented, tagged, and ready for return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for one statue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...When the other workers stood near it, they felt cold. Uneasy. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He had to admit, he didn’t remember seeing it before. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro